+# Version Numbering Scheme
+
+This project has no recorded decision documenting a version numbering scheme. The repository exposes a current version string (`version.go`) and a `CHANGELOG.md` of past releases, but no policy document, ADR, or other recorded artifact specifies the rules governing how version numbers are chosen.
